/// The Home a new kids profile starts with: the collections of the kids
/// profile the set was approved on (films, cartoons, kids' streaming,
/// decades, kids' channels and studios, kids and family discovery, genres,
/// film collections, universes), already trimmed of anything never for
/// children. Built in, so a new kids profile gets it without depending on
/// nuvio.tv answering when it is first opened.
